  "tier": "told-once",
  "plain": "AARO, the Pentagon office that now investigates unexplained aerial reports, hired a company called SANCorp, which a researcher who goes by UAPGerb says specialises in guarding against insider threats and whistleblower leaks. UAPGerb says this on Jesse Michels's show in 2026, and adds that Tim Phillips, an official tied to the office, said on a podcast that SANCorp was hired to connect AARO with subject matter experts. Gerb tells it to suggest the office was more focused on stopping leaks than he claims it admitted."
